@startuml F1.18-D03-presenca-single
title F1.18-D03 — Presença SECRET_SINGLE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "AttendanceController" as Ctrl
participant "ConfirmAttendanceUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: PIN + Confirmar
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /events/{id}/attendance/confirm\n{pin, deviceUuid, fase ENTRADA}
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)

note right of UC
  Valida PIN em memória
  Device binding no INSERT
end note

UC -> Postgres: INSERT presença\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Aluno: Presença registrada

@enduml
